</div>\n        </figcaption>\n      \n    \n      </figure>\n    \n\n    \n\n\n  </div>\n\n  \n\n</div></div></div><div class=\"col sqs-col-5 span-5\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-quote quote-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.quote/1aca65fa-9dc5-44cf-af90-308bc26fc126_926/website.components.quote.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.quote/1aca65fa-9dc5-44cf-af90-308bc26fc126_926/website.components.quote.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.quote\" data-sqsp-block=\"quote\" data-website-component-id=\"5c6997b179a28e51b704\" id=\"block-5c6997b179a28e51b704\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n  \n\n<figure class=\"sqs-quote-block-contents\">\n  <blockquote data-animation-role=\"quote\"\n   data-animation-override>\n    <span>“</span>DDF Consulting, Inc. has been a vital part of Silver Springs Bottled Water’s growth and success. We have worked with Mike Arick and Robert Wood over the past 6 years to implement a completely new accounting system. Over that time we have seen our company grow from 60 people to 120 people and sales doubling. We have found DDF to be a solution driven company in helping Silver Springs Bottled Water implement or improve our payroll, direct deposit, EDI communication with customers, inventory control, production planning, and management control reports. I would highly recommend DDF Consulting Group.”<span>”</span>\n  </blockquote>\n  <figcaption class=\"source\">&mdash; Kane Richmond, CEO Silver Springs Bottled Water</figcaption>\n  \n\n\n\n</figure>\n\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-5c6997b179a28e51b704 {\n    \n    \n    \n  }\n\n  #block-5c6997b179a28e51b704  {\n    \n    }\n\n  #block-5c6997b179a28e51b704 {\n      mix-blend-mod